# public/build is COMMITTED, deliberately.
#
# Hostinger shared hosting has no Node, so the Vite output cannot be produced on
# the server. Committing it is what makes a deploy `git pull` instead of a
# separate upload — and it is what stops the two halves drifting apart, which
# shows up as a blank page and a 404 for an asset hash that no longer exists.
#
# Rebuild and commit it whenever resources/js or resources/css changes.
# /public/build
